{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Guys</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/c971e2af5fd507bca18197d8a20e4dea.poster.avif?t=1763721423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/c971e2af5fd507bca18197d8a20e4dea.webm?t=1763721423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/c971e2af5fd507bca18197d8a20e4dea.mp4?t=1763721423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Ultimate Competitive Multiplayer Racing Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game requires an active internet connection to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Car Guys</i>, an exciting multiplayer racing game where skill and strategy come together in fast-paced, action-packed competitions. Represent your nation and climb the global leaderboard in adrenaline-fueled races that will put your reflexes and driving skills to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Real-Time Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Race against players from around the world in thrilling, high-speed competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy a seamless and lag-free experience powered by <strong>Photon Quantum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Compete for Your Nation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose your country and contribute to its position on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Prove which nation dominates the track and rise to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude97 Action-Packed Racing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Pick up power-ups like missiles and shields to outmaneuver your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Master both offensive and defensive driving strategies to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Vibrant Visuals &amp; Optimized Performance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience colorful graphics and dynamic environments that bring each track to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Smooth gameplay at <strong>60 FPS</strong>, optimized for both PC and mobile devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Extensive Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Personalize your vehicles with unique skins, decals, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose from sleek sports cars to rugged off-road machines\u2014the possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Competitive Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Participate in <strong>daily and weekly championships</strong> inspired by games like <i>Stumble Guys</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Test your skills and earn exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Progression &amp; Meta-Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock <strong>new tracks, vehicles, and upgrades</strong> as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use in-game currency earned from races to enhance your car\u2019s performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Early Access!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Be part of the development and help us improve <i>Car Guys</i> with your feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Your input is crucial to refining the game and making it the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Steam Early Access</strong>: Get a first look at <i>Car Guys</i> before the official release and help us polish the final version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.poster.avif?t=1763721423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.webm?t=1763721423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/extras/462da83b52d3101a7151f0343d21de37.mp4?t=1763721423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/b232016a7ceca26c5fc4ea6aff2d289310dca807.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Driver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/248a56406fb4d784252f52c9a94afff27951579e.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/f6e05d88b3f4fae9e8f4e4cf137d5a70e2a056e4.jpg"},{"name":"Squad Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/890844bde6c7cbefbb856f94136fb44f5e47f34b.jpg"},{"name":"The Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/7cdc3c3d77f8d2e6cc4f446ffd19bea4ce365aab.jpg"},{"name":"Addicted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/de2a06592ed6fec5b5abc400af3930b44c0f03c1.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/d85a63247154db7191b170a698b98432640da410.jpg"},{"name":"Win Streak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/f046aa662ac8cc58a3962c0e48b770c34c104b8f.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/227514c1f2f9ba9e3794e0e55398f80d9253bd27.jpg"},{"name":"Frequent Racer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451500/f45bde44d8ab66889d4c83c7d89c8c126b88f6ff.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451500?t=1763721423","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763721423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/46672bdf91375c8a9059afd705afa0e3cca5abc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763721423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/46672bdf91375c8a9059afd705afa0e3cca5abc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763721423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Guys</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451500/